		<description><![CDATA[Kismet lived at or close by to the Abode for many years, and for most of the time that ! knew her she was receiving dialysis regularly. I remember Pri Vilayat commiserating with her and saying he didn&#039;t know why she had to go through this. But she always seemed to keep up  her spirits. She had the most amazing light filled eyes ( with plenty of mascara, which suited her well). She loved the Cosmic Celebration and the attunements to the angelic planes. She and I used to listen to the recordings of the music from Pir Vilayat&#039;s dramatic presentation of the Cosmic celebration together.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Kismet lived at or close by to the Abode for many years, and for most of the time that ! knew her she was receiving dialysis regularly. I remember Pri Vilayat commiserating with her and saying he didn&#8217;t know why she had to go through this. But she always seemed to keep up  her spirits. She had the most amazing light filled eyes ( with plenty of mascara, which suited her well). She loved the Cosmic Celebration and the attunements to the angelic planes. She and I used to listen to the recordings of the music from Pir Vilayat&#8217;s dramatic presentation of the Cosmic celebration together.</p>
